implementation effort.</p><p><br></p><p><code><strong>Create a render farm =
that uses virtual machines</strong></code> is <strong>incorrect</strong> be=
cause it requires manual provisioning, scaling, and job distribution, which=
 increases the implementation effort. Azure Batch abstracts all of these co=
mplexities, making it a more efficient choice.</p><p><br></p><p><code><stro=
ng>Create a render farm that uses virtual machine scale sets</strong></code=
